<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Pacific Pipeline.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Pacific Pipeline.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on Santa Fe Pacific Pipeline Partners LP to neutral from accumulate and left unchanged the long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/2 to 36-1/8 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
